WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
When you see this picture, do you
get hungry or just pissed off?

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:06.180
It kind of has a cartoonish tone to it.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:07.560
I think it's so ugly!

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.560
That more and more restaurants
are using AI-generated

00:00:10.560 --> 00:00:13.540
images of their dishes has
met with strong criticism.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:15.200
Not least on social media.

00:00:15.420 --> 00:00:17.300
More and more is AI-generated.

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.740
This has to stop!

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:25.100
I've seen crime scene photos less disturbing
than whatever this abomination is.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:26.460
But why is that?

00:00:26.540 --> 00:00:29.860
Through evolution we
have learned to be very

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.800
alert to when something is
a little wrong with food,

00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:38.100
that it is something that signals to
us that it is not good for us to eat.

00:00:38.240 --> 00:00:41.840
But many restaurant owners see the
AI images as a good alternative.

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:47.440
It's cheaper and simpler, and I
started from zero, so I thought

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:50.180
I'd focus on putting this money
into something more important.

